                "<p>​<a href=\"https://www.ird.govt.nz/kiwisaver/kiwisaver-employers/contributions-and-deductions/employer-contributions-to-kiwisaver-and-complying-funds\">Employer contributions to KiwiSaver schemes and complying funds</a>​<br></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Employers must make contributions to their employee’s KiwiSaver scheme or complying fund. They’re called ‘compulsory employer contributions (CEC)’. The lowest rate for the contribution is 3% of the employee’s gross salary or wages."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Is-financial-object-of>
                <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#KiwiSaverContributionProcessing> ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
