        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Recipient of a gift. For the purposes of payroll giving a donee is an organisation listed on the recognised donee list. Refer to \"Confirm charitable tax exemption or donee status\". "@en ;
