                "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);float: none;\">Records dealing with the purchase, installation, testing, maintenance &amp; functioning of information systems used to manage, e.g.: • records and documents • personnel and human resources information (e.g. HRMIS) • finance and accounting records • payroll systems • library information systems (Note: this does not apply to records held within the records systems. When a system becomes defunct, all records should be migrated, remain accessible or be destroyed under authorisation. Please contact Archives New Zealand for advice.)</span><br/></p>"@en ;
