                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Either of the following: a GST group of companies; or two or more persons who are members of a group for which all of the following are true: the persons are all GST registered persons; not all of the persons are companies; the Commissioner of Inland Revenue is satisfied that any of the following is true: one of the persons controls all of the others; a person controls all of the persons."@en ;
