        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "High Wealth Individual (HWI) groups with net worth in excess of $50m, or, in some cases, in excess of $20m with identified complex business structures. HWI  groups  include  associated  parties (individuals,  companies,  trusts  and partnerships). To date we have 250 HWIs and more than 8000 associated parties in the population. HWIs tend to make highly entrepreneurial decisions, rather than structured ones. "@en ;
