        sem:guid          "707d0844-b71f-4a09-99e7-bcc201cac68e" ;
        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#194513751604847607603030> ;
        skos:definition   "Manufacturing industries include units mainly engaged in the physical or chemical transformation of materials, substances or components into new products (except agriculture and construction). The materials, substances or components transformed by units in this division are raw materials that are products of agriculture, forestry, fishing and mining, or products of other manufacturing units."@en ;
