        skos:definition   "Montserrat is a British Overseas Territory in the Caribbean. It is part of the Leeward Islands, the northern portion of the Lesser Antilles chain of the West Indies. Montserrat is about 48 km (30 miles) southwest of Antigua, it is approximately 35–56 km (22–35 miles) northwest of the French island of Guadeloupe, and it is situated about 300 miles (480 km) east-southeast of Puerto Rico. Other neighbouring islands: It is also located southeast of Redonda, an island belonging to Antigua and Barbuda."@en ;
