                "<p><span lang=\"mi-NZ\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"><a href=\"https://irnz.sharepoint.com/sites/CORP-tax-counsel-office/SitePages/What-we-do.aspx\">https://irnz.sharepoint.com/sites/CORP-tax-counsel-office/SitePages/What-we-do.aspx</a></font></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br/><br/></font></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>Knowledge management and Learning and development are known collectively as Knowledge and Development.<br/>Learning and developmnet - provide learning solutions that maintain and enhance tax technical skills and knowledge across IR’s senior tax technical community and support that audience to make accurate technically correct decisions on complex tax technical issues.<br/>Knowledge management - ensure tax technical information is readily available and associated policies and processes are established, operate effectively and are communicated to TCO and the broader tax law community.<strong><br/></strong></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Does-activity>
                <http://smartlogic.com/term#126922907073128218576933> , <http://smartlogic.com/term#95330720266127017159376> ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Evidence>
                <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#NationalLearningAndDevelopment/NTTDUPlanning_en> , <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#NationalLearningAndDevelopment/NationalTechnicalTrainingAndDevelopmentUnit_en> , <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#NationalLearningAndDevelopment/TCOKnowledgeAndDevelopment_en> , <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#NationalLearningAndDevelopment/TaxCounselOfficeKnowledgeAndDevelopment_en> ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Offers-product-service>
