        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Under IGA definitions, any New Zealand Financial Institution or other entity resident in New Zealand that is identified in Annex II of the IGA as a non-reporting NZ FI or that otherwise qualifies as a deemed-compliant FFI, an exempt beneficial owner, or an excepted FFI under relevant US Treasury regulations. "@en ;
