        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>1) A letter sent to the liable parent showing who they are paying child support for and how much they have to pay; </p><p>2) A notice issued by the Commissioner of Inland Revenue giving at least the particulars of the amount of tax to be paid by the taxpayer or the amount of tax to be refunded for an assessment  </p>"@en ;
