        rdf:type               skosxl:Label ;
        sem:rulebaseBehaviour  sem:RulebaseBehaviourExactPhrase ;
        sem:stemming           sem:StemmingOff ;
        skosxl:literalForm     "Offshore RLWT person - Look through company"@en .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#OffshoreRLWTPerson-Trust>
        rdf:type          <http://smartlogic.com/class#Taxpayer> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "A trust is an offshore RLWT person when any of the following apply: - more than 25% of the trustees are offshore RLWT person(s); - more than 25% of people (generally the settlors or trustees) who have the power to appoint or remove trustees or amend the trust deed, are offshore RLWT person(s); - all individual beneficiaries, including discretionary beneficiaries, are offshore RLWT person(s); - all beneficiaries, including discretionary beneficiaries are offshore RLWT person(s); - any individual beneficiary, including discretionary beneficiaries who is an offshore RLWT person: has received a distribution from the trust in any of the four years immediately before the current disposal of residential land, and the total distributions to that beneficiary in one of the four years totalled more than $5,000; any non-individual beneficiary, including a discretionary beneficiary (eg, a company) who is an offshore RLWT person has received a distribution from the trust in any of the four years before the current disposal of residential land; any beneficiary, including a discretionary beneficiary, is an offshore RLWT person and the trust has disposed of residential land within the four years before the current disposal of residential land."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Website glossary"@en ;
        sem:guid          "4e795581-4811-4e0f-bbb0-49e891b7f752" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#OffshoreRLWTPerson> ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#OffshoreRLWTPerson-Trust/OffshoreRLWTPerson-Trust_en> .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#OffshoreRLWTPerson-Trust/OffshoreRLWTPerson-Trust_en>
        rdf:type               skosxl:Label ;
        sem:rulebaseBehaviour  sem:RulebaseBehaviourExactPhrase ;
        sem:stemming           sem:StemmingOff ;
        skosxl:literalForm     "Offshore RLWT person - Trust"@en .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#OffshoreRLWTPerson/OffshoreRLWTPerson_en>
        rdf:type               skosxl:Label ;
        sem:rulebaseBehaviour  sem:RulebaseBehaviourExactPhrase ;
        sem:stemming           sem:StemmingOff ;
        skosxl:literalForm     "Offshore RLWT person - Non individual"@en .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#OffshoreRWLTPerson-Company>
        rdf:type          <http://smartlogic.com/class#Taxpayer> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "For a non-individual that is incorporated or registered in New Zealand they will be an offshore RLWT person when. A company is an offshore RLWT person if: more than 25% of its directors are offshore RLWT person(s), or more than 25% of the shareholder decision making rights are held or controlled by offshore RLWT person(s)."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Website glossary"@en ;
        sem:guid          "316d4c57-1516-40f4-9951-9e3ea1a8fb74" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#OffshoreRLWTPerson> ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#OffshoreRWLTPerson-Company/OffshoreRWLTPerson-Company_en> .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#OffshoreRWLTPerson-Company/OffshoreRWLTPerson-Company_en>
        rdf:type               skosxl:Label ;
        sem:rulebaseBehaviour  sem:RulebaseBehaviourExactPhrase ;
        sem:stemming           sem:StemmingOff ;
        skosxl:literalForm     "Offshore RLWT person - Company"@en .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#OffshoreRWLTPerson-Individual>
        rdf:type          <http://smartlogic.com/class#Party-classification> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "An individual is an offshore RLWT person when any of the following apply: - they're a New Zealand citizen and have been overseas for the last three or more years continuously (and aren't currently in New Zealand); they have a New Zealand residence class visa granted by Immigration New Zealand and have been overseas for the last twelve or more months continuously (and aren't currently in New Zealand); they aren't a New Zealand citizen and don't have a New Zealand residence class visa granted by Immigration New Zealand (can be in or out of New Zealand)."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Website glossary"@en ;
        sem:guid          "4514b227-bdf4-43b5-8e95-3f8066cabce1" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#OffshoreRLWTPerson> ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#OffshoreRWLTPerson-Individual/OffshoreRWLTPerson-Individual_en> .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#OffshoreRWLTPerson-Individual/OffshoreRWLTPerson-Individual_en>
        rdf:type               skosxl:Label ;
        sem:rulebaseBehaviour  sem:RulebaseBehaviourExactPhrase ;
        sem:stemming           sem:StemmingOff ;
        skosxl:literalForm     "Offshore RLWT person - Individual"@en .

