        skos:definition   "We receive details of property sale from Land Information New Zealand (LINZ) every week from the tax statements completed by buyers and sellers of property. This enables us to assess tax obligations with regards to the sale of property, including under the bright-line rules. If you're one of these customers, we contact you shortly after the sale to explain how the income tax rules may apply to your property, and provide guidance on how to plan for it. We also supply a link to a guide to work out what tax you need to pay, removing the uncertainty of guess work."@en ;
        skos:related      <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#LandInformationNewZealand> ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#PropertyCompliance/PropertyCompliance_en> .

