        skos:definition   "Russia, or the Russian Federation, is a country in Eastern Europe and North Asia. It is bordered by 14 countries and two oceans. Its neighbors to the west include Finland, Norway, Estonia, Latvia, Lithuania, Poland, Belarus, and Ukraine. On its southern border are Georgia, Azerbaijan, Kazakhstan, Mongolia, China, and North Korea, while it is bordered by the Arctic Ocean to the north and the Pacific Ocean to the east. "@en ;
