        skos:definition   "Saint Kitts and Nevis, officially the Federation of Saint Kitts and Nevis, is an island country located in the Caribbean consisting of the two islands of Saint Kitts and Nevis, in the Leeward Islands chain of the Lesser Antilles. It is situated southeast of Puerto Rico and southwest of Antigua and Barbuda. The islands are bordered by the Atlantic Ocean to the east and the Caribbean Sea to the west. "@en ;
