        rdf:type               skosxl:Label ;
        sem:rulebaseBehaviour  sem:RulebaseBehaviourExactPhrase ;
        skosxl:literalForm     "Shortfall penalty for not taking reasonable care"@en .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#ShortfallPenaltyForEvasion>
        rdf:type          <http://smartlogic.com/class#Penalty> ;
        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#Is-penalty-for>
                <http://smartlogic.com/term#344256907196264896720404324169574> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "A shortfall penalty imposed on a taxpayer who does any of the following: evades the assessment or payment of tax by the taxpayer or another person under a tax law; knowingly applies an amount of a deduction or withholding tax for any purpose other than in payment to the Commissioner; knowingly does not make a deduction, withholding of tax or transfer of payroll donation required to be made by a tax law; obtains or attempts to obtain a refund or payment of tax to which the person is not entitled; enables or attempts to enable another person to obtain a refund or payment of tax to which the other person is not entitled."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Business Rules business terms"@en ;
        sem:guid          "5ac70b81-d1eb-4532-8422-ab4bf3d34fe1" ;
        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#198463689315270855790496> ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#ShortfallPenaltyForEvasion/ShortfallPenaltyForEvasion_en> .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#ShortfallPenaltyForEvasion/ShortfallPenaltyForEvasion_en>
        rdf:type               skosxl:Label ;
        sem:rulebaseBehaviour  sem:RulebaseBehaviourExactPhrase ;
        skosxl:literalForm     "Shortfall penalty for evasion"@en .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#ShortfallPenaltyForGrossCarelessness>
        rdf:type          <http://smartlogic.com/class#Penalty> ;
        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#Is-penalty-for>
                <http://smartlogic.com/term#756156218607092049138590932424131> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "A shortfall penalty imposed on a taxpayer who, in taking a taxpayer’s tax position, does or does not do something in a way that, in all the circumstances, suggests or implies complete or a high level of disregard  for the circumstances."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Business Rules business terms"@en ;
        sem:guid          "b599b500-6af6-4f56-8d53-0b2f8913b048" ;
        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#198463689315270855790496> ;
        skos:related      <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#Gross-carelessness-shortfall-penalty-template> ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#ShortfallPenaltyForGrossCarelessness/ShortfallPenaltyForGrossCarelessness_en> .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#ShortfallPenaltyForGrossCarelessness/ShortfallPenaltyForGrossCarelessness_en>
        rdf:type               skosxl:Label ;
        sem:rulebaseBehaviour  sem:RulebaseBehaviourExactPhrase ;
        skosxl:literalForm     "Shortfall penalty for gross carelessness"@en .

<http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#ShortfallPenaltyForTakingAnUnacceptableTaxPosition>
        rdf:type          <http://smartlogic.com/class#Penalty> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "A shortfall penalty imposed on a taxpayer who takes tax position that, viewed objectively, fails to meet the standard of being about as likely as not to be correct."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Business Rules business terms"@en ;
