        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>A tax deduction rate worked out to suit individual circumstances. It can be useful if your situation is out of the ordinary, such as:<br/> - you have a second job or other income over and above your main job<br/> - you're a beneficiary, or receiving ACC and working<br/> - you receive an overseas pension that is taxable in New Zealand<br/> - you have business losses to carry forward from previous years, but you're earning a salary or wage now<br/> - you are a non-resident contractor (in certain circumstances).<br/></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Website glossary"@en ;
