        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#LegalDefinition>
                "In relation to the supply of goods and services to any person, consideration includes any payment made or any act or forbearance, whether or not voluntary, in respect of, in response to, or for the inducement of, the supply of goods and services, whether by that person or by any other person; but does not include any payment made by any person as an unconditional gift to any non-profit body."@en ;
