        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfDefinition>
                "<p><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);float: none;\">IR Data Domains and Sub-Domains, v2.5 2021</span><!--EndFragment--></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "An account is a distinct part of the tax system.  E.g. Income tax, GST, Student loan scheme, Working for families. Categorise a table as being in an Accounts sub domain according to its tax type (or across all subdomains if it is contains information relating to all accounts)."@en ;
