        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#LegalDefinition>
                "<p>Associated supply means—<br/>(a) a supply for which the supplier and recipient are associated persons:<br/>(b) a supply of a right, under an equity security or participatory security, to receive for no consideration, or consideration at other than the open market value, a supply of goods and services that is—<br/>(i) not an exempt supply; and<br/>(ii) not a supply relating to the control of the issuer of the equity security or participatory security.<br/></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfLegalDefinition>
