<http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#AuditCases>
        rdf:type          <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#MetadataValue> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfDefinition>
                "IR Data Domains and Sub-Domains, 2020"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfDefinition0>
                "IR Data Domains and Sub-Domains, 2020"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>An investigation by an IR employee into the compliance of an IR customer.​ Information about historical and on-going audits. E.g. The customers, accounts and periods involved, the nature of the non-compliance, discrepancy found, etc.​<br/>Audits provide third-party assurance to various stakeholders that the subject matter is free from material misstatement. The term is most frequently applied to audits of the financial information relating to a legal person. Other commonly audited areas include: secretarial and compliance, internal controls, quality management, project management, water management, and energy conservation. As a result of an audit, stakeholders may evaluate and improve the effectiveness of risk management, control, and governance over the subject matter. Auditing has been a safeguard measure since ancient times.</p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "IR Data Domains and Sub-Domains, 2020"@en ;
        sem:guid          "12ea1a07-2046-46e9-9e35-08f7f567a19f" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#IRInternal> ;
        skos:definition   "Details about audit cases. E.g. which party was audited, which accounts and periods were considered, outcomes, etc.​"@en ;
        skos:historyNote  "<p>Previously divided into two headings, one named Audit case under Case, one named Audit Cases under Work. There was also &#34;Audit&#34; as a high-level heading. Now has a single place under IR Activities.<br/>Updated in December 2021 from version 2.5<br/></p>"@en ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#AuditCases/AuditCases_en> .

<http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#AuditCases/AuditCases_en>
