                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The date of the annual balance of the financial statements for a person, business or other type of entity's tax year. The standard balance date is 31 March. You can only use a different date if you have written approval from Inland Revenue. Non-standard balance dates will either be early (in the six months before the equivalent 31 March balance date) or late (in the six months after 31 March)."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Evidence>
                <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#BalanceDate/NgaRaMutungaTauPutea_en0> ;
