                <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#ChathamIslands> , <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#MarlboroughDistrictCouncil> , <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#Taupo> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BayOfPlenty> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#Canterbury> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#GisborneRegion> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#Hawke-sBay> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#Otago> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#LastReviewedDate>
