        sem:guid          "fc070be7-b22e-4227-a3b8-733924b9dca5" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#AdditionalGlossaryTerm> ;
        skos:scopeNote    "For IR the definition is: \"This describes IR’s changing people and resource needs across the year and how we need to be flexible to meet those needs. For example, at busy times in the tax year we need more resources to meet demand, at other times we need fewer.  Or where we work with external partners to deliver certain services particularly where we have specific projects or expertise requirements.\""@en ;
