        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfDefinition>
                "<p>Coporate Space page about how IR plans and prioritises</p><div><p><!--StartFragment--><a href=\"https://irnz.sharepoint.com/sites/CORP-strategic-portfolio-stewardship/SitePages/How-IR-plans-and-prioritises.aspx#how-we-plan\">How IR plans and prioritises (sharepoint.com)</a><!--EndFragment--><br/></p></div>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Each business group has a plan showing how it will contribute to IR’s enterprise priorities in the upcoming year.  The plans bring together each group’s accountabilities into one place, so we can see the inter-dependencies between them.  Business group plans include budgets, assets, risks, key activities and performance measures."@en ;
        sem:guid          "fb58f2ee-9ca7-4057-b658-ced0d7b00d5c" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessPlan> ;
