                "Future Operating Model glossary 2020"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Capability-based role descriptions describe work in terms of the outcomes be achieved, not detailed tasks and processes. Enabled by devolved decision-making, this allows people greater autonomy to achieve better outcomes for our customers and IR."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Enterprise Services Korero July 2023"@en ;
