                "http://intranet.ird.govt.nz/sdlc/review-boards"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>The role of the CRB is to act as a phase gate for changes being implemented into production using the Operational Readiness Review (ORR). The CRB meets weekly to: <br/>Review and approve/reject in scope changes in context of other relevant changes;<br/>Peer review/validation that IT related changes which have potential impact on customers and operations have:<br/>- had due consideration;<br/>- had suitable risk assessments;<br/>- valid rationale for implementation; <br/>- validation of overall coordination of interrelationships between changes.<br/></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Does-activity>
                <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#ChangeManagement> ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "CCS C&O content"@en ;
