                "Register of Business Products (IR)"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#UsedInSemantics>
                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Inland Revenue assesses and collects child support from liable parents and may require employers to deduct child support payments from an employee’s wages or schedular income. Employers are legally obligated to make these deductions when requested by IR."@en ;
