        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#PartyAttribute> ;
        skos:definition   "Citizenship means being a legal member of a country, with the right to belong there and the responsibility to follow its rules. i.e. It means a country officially recognises you as one of its people. Because of that, you usually get certain rights (like living there permanently, getting a passport, and often voting). You also have responsibilities, such as obeying the law and sometimes paying taxes or serving on juries."@en ;
