        skos:definition   "A COE specifies a common IT architecture within an organisation and promotes interoperability and cross-platform capabilities among an organisation’s devices. All workstations within an organisation run the same software and use the same interfaces so that its devices are standardised and information presentation and platform interfaces are consistent throughout the organisation."@en ;
