                "​https://stax.ird.govt.nz/wcc/faces/wccdoc?dDocName=IRDOC1268615&dID=1330843"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "IR needs a better understanding of our customers in order to manage customer centric design and deliver effective customer experiences. This will assist in positively changing customer compliance behaviour reduce customer’s effort, increase satisfaction and build trust. Customer impact assessment is formalisation of the customer knowledge and insight already in use across Inland Revenue. The CIA methodology ensures these assessments are completed in a consistent and holistic way, focussed on the impacts of change and delivery on customer behaviour. "@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Customer Insight content"@en ;
        <http://smartlogic.com/relationship#Has-retention-class_15_Function_40_RDS_18>
                <http://smartlogic.com/term#4840436255931683250008> ;
        sem:guid          "a2dcc400-3e66-4560-bd82-6275c01f9a38" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#DeliverCustomerServicesInformation> ;
        skos:historyNote  "No recent examples came up in a search on Haukainga in 2025. The examples were all during Business Transformation, 2015-2021."@en ;
