                "Creation of knowledge collection."@en ;
        sem:guid          "802ff41b-6d4d-4336-93d0-9dbf07b075a2" ;
        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#50630129976520997376777> ;
        skos:definition   "Data, information, and knowledge stewardship is the responsible management and oversight of data, information, and knowledge within an organisation. It involves ensuring that data is accurately collected and maintained, information is properly processed and contextualised, and knowledge is effectively synthesised and applied. This stewardship ensures that these resources are used ethically, securely, and efficiently to support decision-making and organisational goals."@en ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Data-Information-AndKnowledgeStewardship/Data-Information-AndKnowledgeStewardship_en> .

