                "<p>Governance bodies register on Architecture SharePoint site<br>​<a href=\"https://irnz.sharepoint.com/sites/kc-architecture/Lists/Authorities/AllItems.aspx?viewid=469db8e0%2D5812%2D40ef%2D937c%2D7beb9c2ec302\" class=\"on\">Architecture - Register of Governance Bodies - All Items (sharepoint.com)</a>​<br></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The Data and Information Lifecycle Working Group is the governance group responsible for the operational governance of data and information throughout its lifecycle.  It is one of the capability working groups focused on governing and maturing our core data, information, and knowledge capabilities.  The working group is sponsored by and accountable to the Data and Information Governance Authority."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Evidence>
