        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The Data and Information Supply Register is the enterprise Register of data and information that is supplied to, supplied by, and supplied around Inland Revenue.  This includes collections and disclosures of Revenue Information.  The Register provides transparency about why we are collecting and disclosing what data and information, and with whom."@en ;
