        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The Data Science Team was part of Data Science and Analytics [now Centre for Enterprise Data Analytics] until November 2021. We work with the rest of IR to get to the heart of the problem, be it big or small, complex or not and provide solutions that inform, support, and enable decisions. We excel at developing innovative, reusable solutions that can be applied to other problems and contexts across IR, promoting consistency and agility. We do this by identifying, collecting and analysing data, identifying patterns and networks of influence, providing predictions, estimations, trends and prioritisations."@en ;
