                "Facilities Management content"@en ;
        sem:guid          "9410e3d0-7b01-47bd-b8db-7b15553cf3ce" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#Delegation> ;
        skos:definition   "Delegation of authority is the process where a person in a higher position in an organisation assigns certain tasks and decision-making power to someone in a lower position, while still retaining overall responsibility. It's a way to distribute workload, empower subordinates, and improve efficiency within an organisation. "@en ;
