        sem:guid            "50adceff-1086-485d-bcc7-23473a69b788" ;
        skos:broader        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Enterprise-IntegrityServices> ;
        skos:definition     "Developing and delivering on strategies to help us and our partners operate more effectively together in the digital space. An important aspect of IR’s strategy is to support and enable partners, providers and intermediaries in the ‘digital tax ecosystem’ to better assist customers. We started this during BT, when we began collaborating with a broad mix of tax agents, accountants, bookkeepers, financial institutions and digital service providers to create better interfaces for exchanging data and processing transactions. The new Digital Ecosystem Strategy team will continue this mahi, making sure we have a clear strategy to guide us in how we invest our time and money. We want to make sure we’re using everything that was created during BT to continue enabling our partners in the ecosystem to become more effective in providing services to our customers."@en ;
        skos:editorialNote  "During a review of business events searched Stax for this term and got 3.249 results. There were numerous false positive results due to the acronym for this term DES. The was one french document that tagged des 81 times. These were also numerous customer files tagged when the customer's first name was Des. Removed acronym 'DES' for this term. During the next reclassification this will update and drop the subject tag Digital Ecosystem Services when it has only found the DES acronym."@en ;
        skos:historyNote    "The Digital Ecosystem Strategy team was established on 15 August 2022. "@en ;
        skosxl:prefLabel    <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#DigitalEcosystemServices/DigitalEcosystemServices_en> .

<http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#DigitalEcosystemServices/DigitalEcosystemServices_en>
