                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>Diversity is about the individual differences and perspectives people bring to work. It includes visible and invisible characteristics such as gender, sexual orientation, age, ethnicity, disability, religion and socio-economic background. It also includes diversity of thought, perspectives and capabilities that as an organisation, we value and benefit from.</p><div>​<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>Equity</strong><br>Is about the way we account for the differences in each individual’s starting point when pursuing a goal or achievement.&nbsp;</p>It means that we work to remove barriers to equal opportunity, by providing support based on the unique needs of each individual, so that everyone can reach their full potential.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Inclusion</strong><br>Is about creating an environment where everyone feels valued and respected and can fully participate in the workplace. It includes recognising and celebrating our diversity, so that everyone feels safe to be who they are, feel like they belong, and can contribute their unique skills and perspectives at work. It also includes removing barriers and providing equal access to opportunities, so that everyone can achieve their full potential.<br></div><div><br></div>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "https://irnz.sharepoint.com/sites/our-organisation/SitePages/D&I-at-IR.aspx"@en ;
        <http://smartlogic.com/relationship#Previously-known-as_4_None_None>
                <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#DiversityAndInclusion/DiversityAndInclusion_en0> ;
        sem:guid          "606a2d86-03a3-41a7-93ff-f7c8fef81156" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/IRD-test-model#Culture> ;
        skos:historyNote  "IR adopted Equity into this phrase in 2023. Confirmed with Domain Specialist from People Strategy & Capability Team Nov 2023. Term updated to include equity, definition updated to include equity and related terms updated as discussed with Domain Specialist."@en ;
        skos:related      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#CrossAgencyRainbowNetwork> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Diversity-EquityAndInclusionRoadmap> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#EmployeeNetworks> ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#DiversityAndInclusion/DiversityAndInclusion_en> .

