                "IT&C content"@en ;
        sem:guid          "1355c000-1d76-4981-9900-3a9692fd2f73" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SoftwareAsAService> ;
        skos:definition   "ECMaaS is a cloud-based service that allows government agencies to manage digital content, such as documents, emails, and other files, in a centralised and standardised way. ECMaaS is part of the New Zealand government's broader digital transformation efforts, aiming to modernise public services and make them more accessible and efficient. As of 2021 the Enterprise Content Management as a Service (ECMaaS) agreement has expired. All services can now be accessed through the Managed Content Services catalogue on Marketplace."@en ;
