                "Required for eligibility modelling."@en ;
        sem:guid          "e7d5ac64-1a79-4796-b89c-3414d073d5e4" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SpouseOrPartner> ;
        skos:definition   "<p>An ex-spouse or ex-partner is someone a person was previously married to, in a civil union with, or in a committed couple relationship with, but is no longer in that relationship.&nbsp;This includes people who are:<br>•\tDivorced<br>•\tSeparated<br>•\tNo longer living together as a couple<br>An ex spouse or ex partner may still have an ongoing connection, for example through shared children, caregiving, financial arrangements, or legal responsibilities, even though the relationship has ended.<br><br></p>"@en ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Ex-spouseOrPartner/Ex-spouseOrPartner_en> .

