        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "A framework providing governance to ensure that Inland Revenue resources and the section 17 power are both used appropriately when obtaining a large volume of data from third parties.  Following the processes under this framework helps to mitigate the legal and reputation risks to Inland Revenue when handling bulk data."@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#IsModelUsedBy>
