                "CCS-I content; Intranet. Māori term supplied by the Māhutonga Team 2022."@en ;
        sem:guid          "f88943c9-790e-4882-a42e-68aef430d54d" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#CustomerAndComplianceServices-Individuals> ;
        skos:definition   "The Families segment distributes Working for Families entitlements and paid parental leave, and collects and distributes child support payments. We do the important job of providing the right entitlements or payments at the right time, with empathy for each family’s situation."@en ;
