        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "CI&A content"@en ;
        sem:guid          "64057073-689e-45e8-8183-99bcb2c1c501" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#Forum> ;
        skos:definition   "The OECD Forum on Tax Administration (FTA), created in 2002, brings together tax commissioners and tax administration officials from over 50 OECD and non-OECD economies. The FTA is a forum through which tax administrators share knowledge, undertake research and develop new ideas to enhance tax administration around the world."@en ;
