        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "A freezing order may restrain a respondent from removing any assets located in or outside New Zealand or from disposing of, dealing with, or diminishing the value of those assets.  An application for a freezing order must be made by interlocutory application under Part 7 or originating application under Part 19 of the High Court Rules."@en ;
