        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The Data & Information Governance Documents Centre is the trusted source for Policies, Standards, Procedures and other authoritative data and information governance documents to support IR's mission and promote consistent best practice. The Data & Information Governance Documents Centre is a living collection and new documents are being identified and published regularly."@en ;
