        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Inter-agencyGroup> ;
        skos:definition   "G-REG’s vision is to make the people working in the regulatory sector better skilled, according to common standards, and more broadly aware of what being part of a wider professional regulatory community means. In early 2015 G-REG was set up by chief executives to improve regulatory practice, regulatory leadership, regulatory culture, and workforce capability in and across state sector organisations and regulatory systems. One of G-REG’s unique key features is that it joins up local and central government together in a way that has simply never happened before."@en ;
