        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#IRRole> ;
        skos:definition   "<p>People in compliance roles check whether customers are doing what the law requires. They look at information, identify risks or issues, contact customers where needed, and take action when obligations haven’t been met.<br>They still work with customers, but the purpose is different from customer service roles: it’s about correctness and fairness, not just help.<br></p>"@en ;
