        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "We are Wāhine Tūhono - Women Connecting. As a network, we advocate for all women within Inland Revenue. As a network, we champion, encourage, support and build capability in the women of IR. We work closely with and support other networks within IR's Diversity and Inclusion space. We organise events and speakers focussing on topics that are relevant to women and are also of interest to all genders."@en ;
