        skos:definition   "Informatica Identity Resolution (IIR) is a software solution designed to help organizations search, match, and manage identity data, including names, addresses, and other related information. It enables accurate and efficient matching of identity data across various systems and formats, even with variations in spelling, language, and data structure. This capability is crucial for tasks like customer relationship management, fraud detection, and regulatory compliance. "@en ;
