        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "An Identity Card serves a number of purposes:*Identification – officer name and designation is displayed.*Evidence of authority - authorises the named officer, to exercise the Commissioner’s powers, which are detailed on the card.*Protects the cardholder by displaying tangible proof of the right to exercise the delegated powers.*Protects taxpayer rights - a taxpayer is entitled to all information concerning delegated authority."@en ;
