        sem:guid          "3a186c23-b3f1-439a-825e-10de49961df0" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Identifier> ;
        skos:definition   "This is the registration number issued by the Companies Office when the KiwiSaver scheme is formally registered. Inland Revenue confirms the scheme registration number once a scheme has an executed Scheme Provider Agreement with IR and a manager’s licence from the Financial Markets Authority (FMA), the Companies Office registers the scheme and issues the KiwiSaver scheme with a registration number."@en ;
