                <http://smartlogic.com/term#112031419964192177804469> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The software customer service staff use to manage customer myIR accounts. It allows them to do the following: - Update email address for myIR; - Reset passwords; - Suspend accounts; - Manage roles; - Cancel UserIDs. MAASI was originally developed to connect customers to FIRST but was migrated to FIRST and START during the co-existence period of Business Transformation. Any changes made in MAASI relate only to myIR and will not be reflected in FIRST or START. MAASI is accessed through the MIRI interface."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Evidence>
                <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#MAASI/SUSI_en> ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "CCS content"@en ;
