                "P&C content."@en ;
        sem:guid          "67eaa3b9-0ef9-4ffc-bff0-cd7e8f32aa5e" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#AcademicQualification> ;
        skos:definition   "<p>The University of Auckland postgraduate qualification,&nbsp;</p><p>MTaxS is designed for graduates of Law or Commerce who wish to extend their understanding of the theoretical issues and legal structures that underpin the taxation system. The programme offers the opportunity for graduates to gain, and for practitioners to update and hone, their knowledge of tax law.&nbsp;</p><p>With technical issues explained by academics and practitioners in the field, the courses predominantly cover&nbsp;legislation and case law applicable to taxation – but also draw from disciplines such as economics and accounting.&nbsp;</p>"@en ;
