                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The Micro business segment manages over 1.5 million IRD numbers. Our customers are often self-employed or sole traders, and include any organisation with less than 6 employees or a GST turnover of under $1 million - companies, not-for-profits, Māori authorities, partnerships, trusts and estates. Many of our customers are non-trading."@en ;
