                "<p>Te aka Māori dictionary <br/></p><p><span lang=\"mi-NZ\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"><a href=\"https://maoridictionary.co.nz/\">https://maoridictionary.co.nz/</a></font></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br/><br/></font></p>"@en ;
