                "<p>​<a href=\"https://www.police.govt.nz/about-us/structure/police-teams-and-units/intelligence\">Intelligence | New Zealand Police | New Zealand Police</a>​<br></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Does-activity>
                <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#IntelligenceGathering> ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
