        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The purpose of the National Property Committee (NPC) is to provide advice and direction on long term property related matters to provide perspectives that help to inform and support property related decisions. In particular the role of the committee is to take a long term view of IR's leased property portfolio (and enabling infrastructure) to ensure is efficiently and effectively meets the changing needs of Inland Revenue."@en ;
