        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#188519164724691362719453> ;
        skos:definition   "The New Zealand Federation of Family Budgeting Services (NZFFBS) was a network of independent, free, and confidential budgeting services across New Zealand that folded in 2019 and was replaced by FinCap (the New Zealand Financial Mentoring Network). FinCap continues the work of the NZFFBS by supporting and developing free financial mentoring services, aiming to reduce financial hardship by improving financial literacy and advocating for system-level changes. "@en ;
        skos:historyNote  "No longer in existence as of 2019, Function continued by FinCap."@en ;
        skos:related      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#BudgetAdvisor> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#FinCap> ;
