        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "This term has been used in relation to B2B message reconciliation in KiwiSaver. The purpose is to provide a non-payment control totals mechanism. This will result in a message count against each message type being sent from Inland Revenue (IR) to the provider and from the provider to IR on a daily basis. This verifies that all sent messages have been received."@en ;
