        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#47372529931203401780288> ;
        skos:definition   "Oracle Identity Management is a comprehensive suite of products and cloud services designed to manage user identities, secure access to enterprise resources, and enforce regulatory compliance. It provides key features such as Single Sign-On (SSO), Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA), and identity governance, enabling organizations to control who accesses what, when, and how. The platform supports both on-premises and cloud deployments and integrates with numerous third-party applications and services. "@en ;
