        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Enterprise Information and Knowledge is an enterprise-focused service supported by four teams - Information & Knowledge Management (IKM), Data and Information Governance & Sharing (DIGS), Digital Product Experience (DPeX) and Library & Research Services (LRS). Our fundamental goal is to provide a co-ordinated approach to the governance and management of IR's data, information and knowledge resources and practices."@en ;
