        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "PIC provides governance over IR's organisational performance, including risk to performance, investment decisions to achieve IR's strategic direction, oversight of the BT Programme deliverables as they are implemented into BAU activity, and governing the benefits realisation."@en ;
