        skos:historyNote  "<p><span style=\"color: black;\">Ran from July 2017 to January 2020.<br/>Was approved to be place in hiatus in February 2020 by CIR with<br/>responsibilities passing to SBG at high level. In August 2020 was approved by<br/>CIR that this committee would not be restarted, alongside Customer Centric<br/>Committee and Organisation Development Committee as IR would move forward with streamlined executive level governance model.</span><span></span></p>"@en ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Performance-InvestmentCommittee/Performance-InvestmentCommittee_en> .

