                "International Revenue Strategy content"@en ;
        sem:guid          "649b947f-826b-4cd5-ae32-cd3033f8b6a1" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#Computer-software> ;
        skos:definition   "Power BI is Microsoft's business analytics service that helps organizations transform raw data into actionable, interactive visualizations and dashboards. It allows users to connect to various data sources, model and visualize the data in reports, and then share these insights across the organization to drive data-informed decisions. The platform consists of several integrated services, apps, and connectors, including the free Power BI Desktop application for report creation and the Power BI service for publishing and sharing reports and dashboards."@en ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#PowerBI/PowerBI_en> .

