                "Stax"@en ;
        sem:guid          "d1741a65-753e-45cc-b3b9-46bc8802b077" ;
        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#36907720899152746377923> ;
        skos:definition   "<p> </p><p>The Powers Manual contains information that will enable you to properly exercise the Commissioner's access and information gathering powers under the Tax Administration Act 1994. The information ranges from the policies you must follow, through to guidelines and procedures that will assist you in considering the appropriate action to take in a given situation.</p><p> </p>"@en ;
