                "<p>Intranet<br/><!--StartFragment--><a href=\"https://irnz.sharepoint.com/sites/kc-data-and-information/SitePages/Privacy-And-Ethics-Assessment-Register.aspx?web=1\">Privacy and Ethics Assessment Register (sharepoint.com)</a><!--EndFragment--><br/></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The Privacy and Ethics Assessment Register is the enterprise register of Privacy and Ethics Assessments.  These assessments are tools for identifying what the potential ethical and privacy impacts on individuals might be.  The Privacy Officer is responsible for maintaining the Register to ensure its content is fit for purpose."@en ;
