        skos:definition   "<p>This is a specialist committee.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 13.5px\">This committee focuses on the rights and freedoms that allow the House of Representatives to do its work and make laws free from outside interference. These are collectively known as \"parliamentary privilege\".</span>​<br></p>"@en ;
