<http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#PrizeCompetition>
        rdf:type          <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#ThirdPartyEvent0> , <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Legally-defined-term> ;
        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#LegalDefinition>
                "A scheme or competition a) for which direct or indirect consideration is paid to a person for conducting the scheme or competition; and b) that distributes prizes of money or in which participants seek to win money; and c) for which the result is determined i) by the performance of the a[participant of an activity of a kind that may be performed more readily by a participant possessing or exercising some knowledge or skill; or ii) partly by chance and partly by performance of an activity as described in subparagraph i), whether or not it may also be performed successfully by chance"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfLegalDefinition>
                "Goods and Services Tax Act 1985"@en ;
