                "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);float: none;\">Intranet - Portfolio 360 site (Glossary and terms)</span><br/><br/></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "A temporary structure, created to co-ordinate, direct and oversee the implementation of a set of related projects, to deliver outcomes and benefits related to IR's strategic objectives. The related projects tend to have inter-related scope and schedule dependencies. A programme is likely to have a lifespan of several years. The temporary structure is closed once the products/objectives/outputs have been delivered, and appropriate roles and responsibilities are transferred to business as usual functions within IR."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Portfolio Office content"@en ;
        sem:guid          "76bab59f-5c88-4dec-9ca1-ecdf540c53f7" ;
