        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The Project Prioritisation and Allocation Committee (PPAC) is part of Policy and Strategy and considers whether or not proposed projects should be included on the tax policy work programme (TPWP). It prioritises new policy project proposals against existing unallocated projects. PPAC may allocate a project to a resource that has appropriate capability and is available to undertake the project."@en ;
