        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#Forum> ;
        skos:definition   "The Public Sector Risk Forum is not an officially named forum, but rather a concept for RiskNZ, the professional body for risk management in New Zealand, to extend and share knowledge and foster collaboration for peers in public and private sectors. The goal is to keep members updated on risk management developments, promote best practices, and build relationships across different agencies and industries. "@en ;
