                "A person who acts as a trustee of a foreign trust that is not registered as a charitable entity under the Charities Act 2005 and where the trustee is resident in New Zealand within the meaning of Section YD 1, YD 2, or YD 3 (excluding section YD 2(2)) of the Income Tax Act 2007. "@en ;
