        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#OperationalPlan> ;
        skos:definition   "Result Action Plans were detailed documents outlining the specific strategies, actions, and responsibilities of different government agencies (lead and contributing) to achieve these challenging BPS targets, such as reducing the number of children in the hospital for avoidable conditions or increasing online government interactions.  Better Public Services (BPS) was a New Zealand government initiative that aimed to improve public services by setting specific, cross-agency targets and focusing on achieving better outcomes for citizens in areas like health, education, and social support. "@en ;
