                "IR provides the ability for customers to submit a variety of returns for personal and business income that must be supplied in accordance with legislation. The service includes the ability to request additional time to meet return filing obligations, change the return, or to advise of additional information relevant to processing the return. IR will communicate with customers about upcoming returns and will provide various forms of information (myIR, forms, letters) to support. IR staff have the ability to update return information. "@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "IR business services register"@en ;
