        sem:guid          "13875372-3880-48dd-805e-5cf5abfddadf" ;
        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#188519164724691362719453> ;
        skos:definition   "Incorporated on 22nd December 1989 as Quill Investments Limited, it’s name was changed in 1990 to Ross Asset Management Limited.The sole Director is David Robert Gilmour ROSS, at the address 105 Woburn Road Lower Hutt 5010. He was appointed at the creation of the company, and has remained in that position ever since. The company was placed in receivership on the 6th Nov 2012. Hundreds of investors believed Ross was managing accounts with investments worth, collectively, almost $380 million, but instead, he had been running a massive Ponzi scheme, and liquidators found only a fraction of the money investors believed they were owed."@en ;
        skos:related      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#PonziScheme> , <http://smartlogic.com/term#208159250929023467470730> ;
        skosxl:altLabel   <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#RossAssetManagementLimited/RossAssetManagement_en> ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#RossAssetManagementLimited/RossAssetManagementLimited_en> .

