        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>A payment of money made to the court to ensure that if a person is unsuccessful, they will be able to pay costs. The security for costs is kept in the court’s trust account until the final outcome of the proceeding. (<a href=\"http://www.justice.govt.nz\">www.justice.govt.nz</a>)<br/></p>"@en , "A payment of money made to the court to ensure that if a person is unsuccessful, they will be able to pay costs. The security for costs is kept in the court’s trust account until the final outcome of the proceeding."@en ;
