        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#Is-template-used-by>
                <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SiteEmergencyTeam> , <http://smartlogic.com/term#33972488389743070613663> ;
        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#IsUsedInEvent>
