                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "We work with and manage over 174,000 small and medium sized business customers. Our customers are organisations with 6 to 49 employees, or a GST turnover of $1 million or more but less than $30 million. We work very closely with the Micro business segment in CCS-I as our customers are similar."@en ;
