                "<p>Intranet</p><div><p>Māori term from IR Māori translation register 2021. Māori term supplied by the Māhutonga Team 2022.</p></div>"@en ;
        sem:guid          "84e750d7-555f-4a40-acaa-8be769d24976" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#CustomerAndComplianceServices-Business> ;
        skos:definition   "The Small to medium enterprises segment manages over 100,000 IRD numbers. Our customers are organisations with 6 to 49 employees, or a GST turnover of $1 million or more but less than $30 million. They include self-employed people, companies and similarly sized trading entities like not-for-profits, partnerships, Māori authorities, trusts and estates. (2025)"@en ;
