                "Text of Protocol document"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The purpose of this Protocol is to provide an overarching and expected approach between Inland Revenue and the Software Developer for the exchange of information with Inland Revenue via a B2B Channel. This Protocol constitutes an agreement that is legally binding on Inland Revenue and the Software Developer. The purpose of this Protocol is to provide an overarching and expected approach between Inland Revenue and the Software Developer for the exchange of information with Inland Revenue via a B2B Channel. This Protocol constitutes an agreement that is legally binding on Inland Revenue and the Software Developer."@en ;
