        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#AbsenceManagement> ;
        skos:definition   "Supporting positive attendance involves creating a work environment where employees feel motivated, supported, and engaged to come to work consistently. Key strategies include fostering a positive company culture, offering flexible work options, clearly communicating attendance policies, rewarding good attendance, and supporting employee wellbeing to prevent burnout and address underlying issues. The goal is to go beyond just penalizing absenteeism to proactively building a culture of trust and support that encourages reliable attendance. "@en ;
