        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Our Tagata Pasifika Network is here to strengthen connections, encourage personal and professional development, and share the rich tapestry of Pasifika knowledge and values within IR. A community that not only advocates for our Pasifika people but also celebrates the unique strengths and talents each member brings. Let's make waves together and create a supportive, dynamic environment where everyone can thrive."@en ;
