        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#207151423851613694154930> ;
        skos:definition   "Multi-national enterprises (MNEs) are required to have in place a solid corporate tax governance structure and an internal fiscal control framework that guarantees that the tax returns and information submitted to the tax administration are complete and correct. Such Tax Control Frameworks (TCF) are a key feature of co-operative compliance and help to build trust."@en ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#TaxGovernance/TaxGovernance_en> .

