        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#147891654668390767194534> ;
        skos:definition   "Terms and Conditions (T&Cs), also known as Terms of Service or Terms of Use, are a legally binding contract between a provider and a user that outlines the rules for using a product, service, or website. These documents define what users and providers can and cannot do, and what happens if obligations aren't met. T&Cs protect businesses by setting clear boundaries, managing user expectations, and providing a framework for legal defence, while also informing users of their rights and responsibilities. "@en ;
