<http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#TrusteeIncome>
        rdf:type          <http://smartlogic.com/class#Income> ;
        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#LegalDefinition>
                "Trustee income” is defined in s HC 7 as an amount of income derived by the trustee of a trust, to the extent to which it is not “beneficiary income”. New Zealand-sourced amounts that are trustee income are always taxed in New Zealand. Foreign-sourced amounts that are trustee income are generally taxed based on the residence of the settlors of the trust, rather than the residence of the trustees."@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfDefinition>
                "General - START Help"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfLegalDefinition>
                "Income Tax Act"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Trustee income is the income derived by a trustee of the trust in any income year that does not vest absolutely in interest in the beneficiaries during the income year or is not paid or applied for the benefit of the beneficiaries during that income year or within six months after the end of that income year. Generally, accrued income to date of death is retained by the trustee, becomes part of the capital of the estate and is treated as trustee income. However, if the will of the deceased person contains a \"non-apportionment clause\", that clause will provide that a beneficiary ie entitled to receive the income accrued to date of death. Therefore, if the accrued income is vested in or paid to the beneficiary, it is treated as beneficiary income."@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#HasRelatedRole>
                <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#Trustee> ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Tax Technical Website Project"@en ;
        sem:guid          "0123d3ae-8a24-43d0-a472-6305a1975342" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#EstateAndTrustIncome> ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#TrusteeIncome/TrusteeIncome_en> .

<http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#TrusteeIncome/TrusteeIncome_en>
        rdf:type               skosxl:Label ;
        sem:rulebaseBehaviour  sem:RulebaseBehaviourExactPhrase ;
        skosxl:literalForm     "Trustee income"@en .

