        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Inter-agencyGroup> ;
        skos:historyNote  "An 11 member Welfare Expert Advisory Group (WEAG) was established in mid-2018 to provide advice to the Government on options that could best give effect to its vision for the future direction of the social welfare system. The report was delivered in 2019 and the WEAG was wound up thereafter."@en ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#WelfareExpertAdvisoryGroup/WelfareExpertAdvisoryGroup_en> .

