        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The Cheque Duty Repeal Act 2014 has abolishes cheque duty, with effect from 1 July 2014. Cheque duty is no longer payable on cheques printed or supplied by a bank to its customers. Cheque duty is also no longer payable on bills of exchange for which cheque duty has not been prepaid."@en ;
