                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The Commissioners Awards celebrate our people who do a great job and have embraced our culture, values and behaviours to make IR a better place to work. The awards celebrate individuals and teams and are given in five categories. These categories are:​​​​​​​ Toitū te Tangata - Spirit of Service; Mahi Tahi - Collaboration; Tū Rangatira - Leadership; He Waka Eke Noa - Diversity and Inclusion; Tū Tangata - Our People."@en ;
