        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The account held in IR for a business that is a member of the Environmental Restoration Account Scheme. Some business activities cause environmental damage when they discharge a contaminant. The business must later restore this damage. The environmental restoration account (ERA) scheme allows businesses to set money aside to cover their monitoring or restoration costs to do this."@en ;
