                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Some business activities cause environmental damage which the business must restore later – often in future income years, or the business may need to mitigate noise. For accounting purposes, the business may wish to set restoration or mitigation money aside in the earlier years when the damage occurs, to cover the cost in later years."@en ;
