                <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#FixedTermAgreement/ESDD_en> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#FixedTermAgreement/FTABureau_en> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#FixedTermAgreement/FinnishTaxAdministration_en> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#FixedTermAgreement/ForumOnTaxAdministration_en> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#FixedTermAgreement/FreeTradeAgreement_en> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#FixedTermAgreement/TaxAdministration_en> ;
