        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#188519164724691362719453> ;
        skos:definition   "The Government Communications Security Bureau (GCSB) is a public service agency. Our mission is to provide our customers with intelligence advantage and cyber resilience to successfully navigate an unpredictable world. We are New Zealand’s lead organisation for Signals Intelligence (SIGINT), meaning we specialise in intelligence derived from electronic communications. We also provide cyber security and resilience for organisations of national significance. We contribute to: The protection of New Zealand’s national security; The international relations and wellbeing of New Zealand; and The economic well-being of New Zealand."@en ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#GovernmentCommunicationsSecurityBureau/GovernmentCommunicationsSecurityBureau_en> .

