        skos:broader      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#TaxpayerClassification> ;
        skos:definition   "Non-individual means a body corporate, including separate legal entities. In New Zealand that includes a company, partnership, estate, charity, trust, club, society, superannuation scheme or Māori authority, an offshore and non-resident company, partnership, club, society, trust, charity, estate, superannuation scheme. It includes any entity whose activities include being an employer, selling goods and services, buying, selling or transferring property in New Zealand, and/or in the property rental business."@en ;
