        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "A scheme offered by companies whereby the company advises all its shareholders that they will be issued with bonus shares on a particular date. The shareholders are asked if they would like to have the company repurchase those bonus shares immediately after the shareholder receives them. If the shareholder does not elect to have some or all of their bonus shares repurchased, the default option is for the shareholder to retain the bonus shares."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "IR website"@en ;
