                <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#SolutionArchitectureDesign/ArchitecturalChanges_en> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#SolutionArchitectureDesign/ArchitectureDecisionRequest_en> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#SolutionArchitectureDesign/ConceptualArchitectureView_en> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#SolutionArchitectureDesign/EnvironmentLandscapeStrategy_en> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#SolutionArchitectureDesign/FeatureEngineering_en> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#SolutionArchitectureDesign/FunctionalArchitecture_en> ;
