        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#LegalDefinition>
                "<p>Theft or stealing is the act of,—<br/>(a) dishonestly and without claim of right, taking any property with intent to deprive any owner permanently of that property or of any interest in that property; or<br/>(b) dishonestly and without claim of right, using or dealing with any property with intent to deprive any owner permanently of that property or of any interest in that property after obtaining possession of, or control over, the property in whatever manner.<br/></p>"@en ;
