        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>Totalisator duty is sometimes referred to as Racing duty. Totalisator duty used to be payable on all racing and sports betting. The duty was a percentage (%) of betting profits for all racing and sports betting. Now, there is no duty, but the problem gambling levy component remains. <br><br>Problem gambling levy is collected to fund services for the prevention and treatment of problem gambling.</p>"@en ;
