                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Inland Revenue's Executive-Level Governance System leads and guides the organisation, making sure we're doing the right things in the right way. As well as steering us today, our governors look out to the long term, ensuring sustainability for the future. They ensure we're ready for tomorrow's challenges and opportunities and can meet the changing expectations of our customers, our people, and the Government."@en ;
