        skos:definition   "AA Smartfuel Ltd provided a New Zealand loyalty programme that offered fuel discounts for members at partner fuel stations and retailers, but the programme officially ended on January 31, 2024. A joint venture between AA and its partners, the programme was wound down to allow the NZ Automobile Association (AA) to focus on its broader AA Member Benefits programme."@en ;
