        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The evaluation or estimation of the amount of tax for a taxpayer and means all of the following for the purposes of tax law: an assessment of tax made under a tax law by a taxpayer or by the Commissioner of Inland Revenue; an assessment of a net loss for the purposes of the Income Tax Act 2007; an assessment of terminal tax or a refund for the purposes of the Income Tax Act 2007; an assessment of a refund due under the Goods and Services Act 1985; an amendment by the Commissioner of Inland Revenue of an assessment."@en ;
