        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Integrity & internal assurance ensures Inland Revenue has a continuous focus on assurance activity and maintaining appropriate standards of integrity and conduct. We support leaders with managing associated high-level risks and issues. Our team provides education and advice on behavioural integrity and controls, managing risks, and the management of wrong-doing in the workplace. We focus on helping people do the right thing. "@en ;
