                "<p>Casino duty is payable by casino operators on gambling profits. The duty is a percentage (%) of the casino wins, and includes a Problem Gambling Levy component (which also attracts GST). </p><p><br></p><p>You need to pay a problem gambling levy on all gambling profits.&nbsp;Problem gambling levy is collected to fund services for the prevention and treatment of problem gambling.</p>"@en ;
