                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "All individuals, businesses, and organisations operating in New Zealand are subject to taxation on income derived from their activities. In circumstances where income is generated from investments or other non-salary sources, the entity making the payment may be legally obligated to withhold the applicable tax and remit it directly to Inland Revenue on behalf of the income recipient."@en ;
