        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#LegalDefinition>
                "<p>(a) A civil penalty imposed under section 139B of the Tax Administration Act 1994 or not paying a tax calculated or assessed as payable under a tax law on time; and<br/>(b) for sections 157, 183A and 183D includes:<br/>- interest on unpaid totalisator duty under section 8 of the Gaming Duties Act 1971 for all betting profits that must be calculated under section 4 of that Act:<br/>- interest on unpaid racing duty under section 12 of the Gaming Duties Act 1971 for lotteries drawn:<br/>- interest on unpaid gaming machine duty under section 12F of the Gaming Duties Act 1971 for dutiable games played by means of gaming machines:<br/>- interest on unpaid casino duty under section 120 of the Gaming Duties Act 1971 for casino wins.<br/></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
