<http://smartlogic.com/term#460716479585426992918781858541954>
        rdf:type          <http://smartlogic.com/class#Income> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#IsDisplayedUnder>
                <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#CustomerAttributes> ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfDefinition>
                "General - START Help. Business Rules business terms"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfDefinition0>
                "Britannica Money"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#usedAsIRTopic>
                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The courts have defined some characteristics of income.  These can be summarised as: income is something that comes in, in money or in money's worth; income is received for goods or services or money supplied; a receipt that is of regular nature and is suggestive of income; when a person is reliant on a source of money for their support, this suggests it is income. These characteristics individually may not indicate that money is income but a combination of them would be more persuasive. Each characteristic defines income as money received or monetary value which is received. Monetary value means it can be converted to money."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "<p>Information Domain Context Manual; Business Rules business terms</p><div><p>IR Glossary</p></div>"@en ;
        sem:guid          "a6bb6402-c889-5bb9-bc8e-58eb2f7bda22" ;
        skos:broader      <http://example.com/IRD-test-model#Money> ;
        skos:definition   "Income is any money you receive. Depending on purpose, the income is categorised. For example, \"taxable income\" versus \"non-taxable income\"."@en ;
        skos:related      <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#FinancialStatus> , <http://smartlogic.com/term#887723003806157097850899243914306> ;
        skosxl:prefLabel  <http://smartlogic.com/label#460716479585426992918781858541954_English> .

