                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>Lottery duty is payable by the New Zealand Lotteries Commission. The duty is a percentage (%) of the nominal value of all tickets in a game, the duty includes a Problem Gambling Levy component (which also attracts GST). <br>Problem gambling levy is collected to fund services for the prevention and treatment of problem gambling.</p>"@en ;
