        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfDefinition>
                "IKM-compiled definition taken from a number of internal sources"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>Turnover is the total gross value of all goods and services supplied, excluding GST. It includes: </p><p>* goods and services sold or provided in New Zealand </p><p>* exported goods </p><p>* grants, subsidies and barter arrangements. </p><p>It does not include: </p><p>* the sale of stock and assets because of the winding down or ceasing of business </p><p>* the sale of plant or replacement of assets </p><p>* GST-exempt goods and services </p><p>* unconditional gifts. </p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "Website glossary"@en ;
        sem:guid          "14198c69-9e93-57c3-a569-108dc4731a2e" ;
