                false ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "A shortfall penalty imposed on a person when all of the following are true: the person promotes, offers, or sells an arrangement to ten or more people in an income year; a taxpayer becomes a party to the arrangement; a shortfall penalty for an abusive tax position is imposed on the taxpayer as a result of the arrangement."@en ;
