        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfDefinition>
                "<p><span lang=\"mi-NZ\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"><a href=\"https://irnz.sharepoint.com/sites/kc-tax-law-community/SitePages/TLC%20expertise.aspx\">https://irnz.sharepoint.com/sites/kc-tax-law-community/SitePages/TLC%20expertise.aspx</a></font></span></p><p><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br/><br/></font></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "The National Rulings Committee provides governance and oversight of the binding rulings process. One of its prime areas of focus is to ensure that common issues and consistency involving the two areas providing binding rulings can be discussed and monitored."@en ;
