        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#LegalDefinition>
                "<p>A body corporate or other entity that has a legal existence separate from that of its members, whether it is incorporated or created in New Zealand or elsewhere and for the purposes of the Goods and Services Tax Act 1985 it includes a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 2008 and excludes<br/>  · a local authority<br/>  · a public authority.<br/></p>"@en ;
