                "Oxford dictionary."@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfLegalDefinition>
                "Income Tax Act 2007, s YA 1, (Reprint as at 14 May 2016)  and Goods and Services Tax Act 1985, s 2 (Reprint as at 2 June 2016)"@en ;
