        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#SourceOfDefinition0>
                "Wikipedia"@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "<p>ACC is a statutory entity under section 7(1) the Crown Entities Act, as it is an entity established under or by an Act.<br/>Inland Revenue was a collection agency for the Accident Compensation Corporation up until 30 June 2003.<br/></p>"@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Evidence>
