        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "A form or document that a taxpayer is required to complete and return to the Commissioner, whether in electronic or written form and whether provided in relation to a period or not, including a tax form issued by one taxpayer that another taxpayer provides to the Commissioner of Inland Revenue but does not include the prescribed form or electronic format under section 185K of the Tax Administration Act 1993."@en ;
