        rdf:type          <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Legally-defined-term> , <http://smartlogic.com/class#Information> ;
        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#LegalDefinition>
                "A document for which all of the following are true: the document is issued because the price of a supply has reduced after a tax invoice has been issued; the document contains all relevant information required to be provided in the document under the Goods and Services Tax Act 1985  and includes a document deemed to be a credit note under s 25(3A) of the Goods and Services Tax Act 1985."@en ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Instance>
