                true ;
        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "ESCT is a tax on employer superannuation cash contributions an employer makes to a superannuation fund for the benefit of an employee.  This tax applies is to all employer contributions being made, not just those to a KiwiSaver scheme e.g. defined benefit fund."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Evidence>
                <http://smartlogic.com/term#79347698687633970825017780444902/PAYE-SuperannuationContributionTaxes_en> ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
                "IR concept model; Business Rules business terms; PAS content"@en ;
