        <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel-current-#BusinessDefinition>
                "Enables an eligible taxpayer to level out their gross income from year to year by permitting income equalisation deposits with the Commissioner and allowing a deduction for the amounts deposited in this manner."@en ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Evidence>
                <http://smartlogic.com/term#889308461551267286441058317569518/IncomeEqualisationRules_en> , <http://smartlogic.com/term#889308461551267286441058317569518/NgaKaupapaWhakaoriteMoniWhiwhi_en0> ;
        <http://example.com/NZ-IRD#Source-of-term>
