        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#Has-source-of-rules>
                <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#Taxation-GSTAndMiscellaneousProvisions-Act2000> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#GSTCompulsoryZeroRatingRules> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#GoodsAndServicesTax-GrantsAndSubsidies-Order1992> , <http://example.com/InlandRevenueModel#Taxation-GSTAndRemedialMatters-Act2010> , <http://smartlogic.com/term#769477633007581059603718679399876> ;
        <http://example.com/Cleaned-Inland-Revenue-model#Maori>
