        skos:broader      <http://smartlogic.com/term#41270193211275050540129> ;
        skos:definition   "In a tax system, the tax rate is the ratio (usually expressed as a percentage) at which a business or person is taxed for a specific product. There are several methods used to present a tax rate: statutory, average, marginal, and effective. These rates can also be presented using different definitions applied to a tax base: inclusive and exclusive."@en ;
