        skos:definition   "Chartered Accountants Australia and New Zealand (CA ANZ) is a professional accounting body representing over 140,000 financial professionals in Australia, New Zealand, and internationally. It promotes the Chartered Accountant (CA) designation and upholds high ethical standards, offering services and education to members and advocating for the public good."@en ;
